<title>The idea of stability of equilibria for discrete dynamical systems</title>

<p><ref>Video</ref> | <ref>Applet</ref> | <ref>Transcript</ref> </p>



<description>
An introduction to the concept of stable and unstable equilibria and how to use cobwebbing to identify stability.
</description>

